---
import '../styles/global.css';

Astro.response.status = 500;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>Terjadi kesalahan</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-dasar font-sans text-stone-900 antialiased">
    <main class="flex min-h-dvh flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-12 text-center">
      <span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-stone-900 font-sans text-sm font-bold text-white">
        HP
      </span>
      <p class="mt-6 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-aksi-teks">Kesalahan 500</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900">Ada yang rusak di sisi kami</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm text-stone-600">
        Halaman ini gagal dimuat. Coba muat ulang sebentar lagi. Kalau masih sama, kembali ke beranda lewat tautan di bawah.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/"
        class="target-sentuh mt-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-aksi px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-emerald-800"
      >
        Ke beranda
      </a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
